scale: ~13481 lines across 46 files [XL]

- **`vox-orchestrator` crate**:
  - Added `OrchestratorPolicy` facade to compose all ten decision axes (D1-D10) into a single `PolicyDecision`.
  - Implemented `CircuitBreaker` (D6) with five-signal doom-loop detection, including `TripReason`, `AlarmTier`, `CircuitBreakerState`, `CircuitBreakerConfig`, `bigram_jaccard`, and `TripEvent` metrics.
  - Implemented `ConfidenceFuser` (D3) for composite scoring, fusing five signals (evidence_quality, citation_coverage, source_diversity, contradiction_penalty, entropy_score) into `AnswerDirectly`/`InvokeSocrates`/`Insufficient` decision tiers.
  - Implemented `TierCascadeRouter` (D1) for three-tier model routing (Economy/Standard/Strong) based on complexity, circuit-breaker alarm level, confidence, and budget.
  - Implemented `PlanModeTrigger` (D2) for React vs. PlanAndExecute selection using four signals (complexity, dependency_count, tool_hint_count, prior_adequacy_score).
  - Implemented `RiskMatrix` (D5+D9) for four-dimension HITL escalation scoring (irreversibility, blast_radius, compliance_exposure, confidence_deficit) mapping to `Low`/`Medium`/`High`/`Critical` grades and `Proceed`/`WarnContext`/`Escalate`/`BlockAndEscalate` actions.
  - Implemented `PrivacyClassifier` (D8) for classifying signals into `Public`/`Internal`/`Private`/`Regulated` and level-aware routing.
  - Implemented `CachePredictor` (D7) for hit prediction, `OrchestratorBudgetGate` (D7) for token/cost management, and `CompactionTrigger` (D7) for context utilization.
  - Implemented `CalibrationLoop` (D10) for Welford online variance drift detection and `ContextualBandit` for greedy Beta-posterior bandit selection.
  - Implemented `DispatchRouter` (D4) for sub-agent spawn vs. inline decisions based on complexity, budget, and chain depth.
  - Added `EscalationRequired`, `SubAgentDispatched`, and `ChainDepthAlert` variants to `AgentMessage`.
  - Fixed clippy warnings, updated `budget_gate` to clamp inputs and reset `triggering_fraction`, and aligned `calibration` docs.
  - Added `Display` implementations for `RiskGrade`, `PrivacyLevel`, `PrivacyRoutingDecision`, `AlarmLevel`, and `RoutingTier` for stable telemetry strings.
  - Corrected `risk_matrix` hard-critical override to include `confidence_deficit`.
